Synthetic demo data for Milestone 3.1 Slice 2 tenant-isolation testing (see ADR 0014) -- not a real customer report.

```python
@app.route("/reports/<int:report_id>")
def view_report(report_id):
    report = Report.query.get(report_id)
    return render_template("report.html", report=report)
```

When report_id does not exist, this raises an unhandled AttributeError instead of returning a 404. Expected a clean not-found response.
